going wrong

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:37.280
tic leti and montrose will be able to
leave artem to return to chicago

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:41.840
but sadly uncle george didn't survive. it
might seem strange to have all this

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:45.919
happen so early in the season
but for what it's worth this is the way

00:07:45.919 --> 00:07:48.960
the book is set up as well.
the book is put together like a

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:53.039
collection of stories that are all
different but connected and this trip to

00:07:53.039 --> 00:07:56.879
